<section id="t-overview" class="tab on">
<div class="card">
<div class="eyebrow">Executive summary <span class="pill g">Live since 03 Sep 2026</span></div>
<h2>From an opaque Smart Campaign to a controlled B2B Search campaign</h2>
<p>In February I audited Digicraft's Google Ads account: a Smart Campaign whose 285 reported conversions were Google Maps actions. I built form-lead tracking in Google Tag Manager, launched a Standard Search campaign on 3 September 2026, and optimised it using search-term and Change history evidence. By 24 to 30 September CTR reached 9.40% at AED 11.41 CPC. No verified lead has been recorded yet, and this page says so.</p>
<p class="mut">By Suhaila, Digital Marketing Officer, Digicraft Interior Design. February to October 2026.</p>
</div>
<div class="grid">
<div class="stat"><b>9.40%</b><span>CTR, 24 to 30 Sep (7.66% in 3 to 23 Sep)</span></div>
<div class="stat"><b>AED 11.41</b><span>Avg. CPC, 24 to 30 Sep (AED 13.06 before)</span></div>
<div class="stat"><b>67.5%</b><span>Impression share, 1 to 7 Oct (41.7% across 3 to 30 Sep)</span></div>
<div class="stat"><b>0</b><span>Verified leads. Tracking is live; the only confirmed conversion was my test</span></div>
</div>
<div class="card" style="margin-top:18px">
<div class="eyebrow">Results by phase</div>
<table><tr><th>Phase</th><th>What was running</th><th>Clicks/day</th><th>Spend/day</th><th>CTR</th><th>Avg. CPC</th></tr>
<tr><td>3 to 23 Sep</td><td>Maximize Clicks, AED 83 daily budget</td><td>6.7</td><td>AED 87</td><td>7.66%</td><td>AED 13.06</td></tr>
<tr><td>24 to 30 Sep</td><td>Manual CPC (AED 14 max), new headlines, 12 more keywords</td><td>8.7</td><td>AED 99</td><td>9.40%</td><td>AED 11.41</td></tr>
<tr><td>1 to 7 Oct</td><td>Daily budget raised to AED 270</td><td>24.7</td><td>AED 298</td><td>8.46%</td><td>AED 12.07</td></tr></table>
<p class="mut">24 to 30 Sep is 7 days and 61 clicks, and several changes landed together, so read the gain as encouraging rather than proven. Full 3 to 30 Sep: 2,476 impressions, 201 clicks, 8.12% CTR, AED 12.56 CPC, AED 2,524.53 spend.</p>
</div>
</section>

<section id="t-audit" class="tab">
<div class="card"><div class="eyebrow">Deep-dive diagnostics</div><h2>What the audits found</h2><p>Four findings from the February Smart Campaign audit (23 issues in total), then four from the live Search campaign.</p></div>
<div class="grid">
<div class="dg r"><div class="top"><span class="pill r">Critical</span><span class="no">FEB #01</span></div><h3>Maps actions counted as conversions</h3><p>The 285 "conversions" at AED 5.53 each were local Maps actions. No form, call or WhatsApp enquiry was tracked.</p></div>
<div class="dg"><div class="top"><span class="pill a">Control</span><span class="no">FEB #02</span></div><h3>No keyword control</h3><p>A Smart Campaign hands keywords, bids and targeting to Google. Spend rose 17% while clicks fell 1.5%, and CPC went from AED 1.05 to AED 1.25.</p></div>
<div class="dg b"><div class="top"><span class="pill b">Leakage</span><span class="no">FEB #03</span></div><h3>AED 80.85 of visible waste</h3><p>AED 33.91 on irrelevant searches plus AED 46.94 on the company's own brand name: 5.1% of the budget.</p></div>
<div class="dg"><div class="top"><span class="pill a">Ad quality</span><span class="no">FEB #04</span></div><h3>Errors in the live ads</h3><p>A spelling error in the ad title, 8 of 14 headlines weak or duplicated, and 4 descriptions cut off or ungrammatical.</p></div>
<div class="dg r"><div class="top"><span class="pill g">Fixed 4 Sep</span><span class="no">SEP #05</span></div><h3>Day one on broad match</h3><p>The first day cost AED 140.76 for 191 impressions, 10.5% of the 3 to 18 Sep spend. Keywords moved to phrase match with four negative lists.</p></div>
<div class="dg b"><div class="top"><span class="pill g">Fixed 24 Sep</span><span class="no">SEP #06</span></div><h3>Maximize Clicks, AED 35 limit</h3><p>CPC averaged AED 13.06 in 3 to 23 Sep. Manual CPC capped at AED 14 followed, and CPC fell to AED 11.41.</p></div>
<div class="dg r"><div class="top"><span class="pill r">Open</span><span class="no">SEP #07</span></div><h3>Searches for other companies</h3><p>Spend on other companies' names grew from about 4% to 15% to 38% across the three windows. Negative lists could not keep up.</p></div>
<div class="dg r"><div class="top"><span class="pill r">Open</span><span class="no">SEP #08</span></div><h3>Quality Score 3/10</h3><p>Landing page experience stayed below average through 7 Oct, so the page is the main brake on rank and cost.</p></div>
</div>
</section>

<section id="t-playbook" class="tab">
<div class="card"><div class="eyebrow">Remediation playbook</div><h2>What I changed, and when</h2><p>Dates from the account's Change history, so each step can be checked.</p></div>
<div class="card"><ul class="tl">
<li><span class="d">27 FEB</span><h3>Audit report on the Smart Campaign</h3><p>23 issues found. Recommended rebuilding as Standard Search with tracking fixed first.</p></li>
<li><span class="d">BEFORE LAUNCH</span><h3>Conversion tracking in Google Tag Manager</h3><p>Trigger on the form thank-you page, Google Ads conversion tag and Conversion Linker, one conversion per interaction, 90-day window. Verified with a test submission.</p></li>
<li><span class="d">3 SEP</span><h3>Campaign goes live</h3><p>Maximize Clicks (AED 35 limit), broad match keywords, AED 83 daily budget, lead-form and call goals added.</p></li>
<li><span class="d">4 SEP</span><h3>Negative lists and phrase match</h3><p>Four negative keyword lists applied. Five keywords moved from broad to phrase match.</p></li>
<li><span class="d">10 TO 12 SEP</span><h3>Assets and URL</h3><p>Image asset, two sitelinks and new headlines added. Final URL set to <code>/fitout-services/</code>.</p></li>
<li><span class="d">24 SEP</span><h3>Manual CPC and tighter targeting</h3><p>Switched to Manual CPC (AED 14 max), added 17 ad-group negatives (competitors, jobs, DIY, free) and replaced the headlines.</p></li>
<li><span class="d">25 TO 26 SEP</span><h3>Messaging and keyword expansion</h3><p>New headlines and URL paths, 12 more keywords, and the call-lead goal removed.</p></li>
<li><span class="d">30 SEP</span><h3>Budget raised</h3><p>Daily budget increased from AED 83 to AED 270.</p></li>
</ul></div>
</section>

<section id="t-analytics" class="tab">
<div class="card"><div class="eyebrow">Performance data deep-dive</div><h2>Phase-by-phase analytics</h2><p>Windows: 3 to 23 Sep, 24 to 30 Sep (after the Manual CPC change) and 1 to 7 Oct (after the budget raise).</p></div>
